          "text": "Description: On May 20, 2008, a witness reported by email having seen a few days earlier (he cannot remember the exact date) a glowing ball that was first stationary and then moved towards the North without making a sound. The too brief testimony (exact date unknown) makes any investigation impossible, but the observation resembles those of Thai lanterns observed in the same region at the same time.",
